OL,3,GNEWSA'I tried to take my own life, then
OL,4,Aran the coast of Britain'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I don't just enjoy running, I
OL,7,Fabsolutely love it, and when I'm not
OL,8,Frunning, I miss it so much," says Megan
OL,9,FBoxall.
OL,11,FBack in May, the 33-year-old, from
OL,12,FThorpeness, in Suffolk, conquered the
OL,13,Flast of 200 marathons over 204 days,
OL,14,Fraising more than #72,000 for
OL,15,FSamaritans.
OL,17,FThe financial journalist, who was born
OL,18,Fin Hertfordshire, became the quickest
OL,19,Fwoman to run Britain's coastline,
OL,20,Fcovering 5,240 miles (8,433km).
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
