OL,3,GNEWSA'I tried to take my own life, then
OL,4,Aran the coast of Britain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany would consider completing a
OL,7,Fchallenge of this magnitude impressive
OL,8,Fenough, but Megan did it after being
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with multiple sclerosis (MS).
